          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "- WS /ws/sessions/:id; on 'ready' it reads the attempt id from sessionStorage and submits once; 'Try again' after an error reconnects to the same attempt (useEvaluationStream.ts)\n- A final evaluation redirects to /result 1500ms after complete\n- Follow-up turns have no client cap; a failed follow-up submit releases the Send button\n- WS close 4001 clears the token and redirects to /?error=session_expired\n- On error the bottom band reads 'Evaluation stopped.'",
